cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "mef3io: MEF 3.0 (Multiscale Electrophysiology Format) read/write with a single C++ core and Python/MATLAB bindings"
abstract: "mef3io reads and writes MEF 3.0 (Multiscale Electrophysiology Format) recordings, such as EEG, intracranial EEG and ECG, from Python, MATLAB and C++. One C++ core implements the format; files it writes open in meflib, pymef and mef_tools, and theirs open in mef3io."
message: "If you use mef3io in research, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Mayo Clinic — Bioelectronics Neurophysiology and Engineering Lab (BNEL)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/bnelair/mef3io"
url: "https://bnelair.github.io/mef3io/"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - MEF
  - electrophysiology
  - EEG
  - iEEG
  - ECG
  - MEF 3.0
  - Multiscale Electrophysiology Format
  - time series
  - file format
